@host = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-jwt-access-token

### List Group Types
GET {{host}}/api/groups/types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Small Group Type
POST {{host}}/api/groups/types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Small Group",
  "groupTerm": "Small Group",
  "groupMemberTerm": "Member",
  "allowMultipleLocations": false,
  "isMeetingStyleEnabled": true,
  "enableGroupHistory": true,
  "takesAttendance": true,
  "groupCapacityRule": "Soft",
  "isSchedulingEnabled": false,
  "initialRoles": [
    { "name": "Leader", "isLeader": true, "canEdit": true, "canManageMembers": true, "canTakeAttendance": true },
    { "name": "Member", "isLeader": false, "canView": true }
  ]
}

### Get Group Hierarchy Tree
GET {{host}}/api/groups/tree?includeInactive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PostGIS Group Finder Search (10 mile radius around Denver)
POST {{host}}/api/groups/finder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 39.7392,
  "longitude": -104.9903,
  "radiusMeters": 16093.44,
  "publicOnly": true,
  "activeOnly": true,
  "hasOpenCapacityOnly": true
}

### Run GroupSync Reconciliation
POST {{host}}/api/groups/sync/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forceRun": true
}

### Attendance Metrics Summary
GET {{host}}/api/groups/attendance/metrics?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
